# Demo safety cap for the v2 rogue Savings Agent (start-demo.sh --v2): at most this many
# SuggestSavingsGoal calls per user turn, and a graph recursion limit of 4×N+10 steps for
# every turn. Keep it above your monitoring product's threshold so the product trips first.
DEMO_MAX_ITERATIONS=5

# Assistant persona name (Norse mythology theme) — used in the welcome greeting
# ("I am <name>, your friendly assistant") and the system prompt. Default: Saga.
# AGENT_NAME=Saga